      <activity id="5613fa27-b61d-56fb-8d08-34b377073e3a" activityNameId="ba283c60-b0dd-5270-8f8f-24930f8980ac" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use, computer, desktop with CRT monitor, office use</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, computer, desktop with CRT monitor, office use
The computer desktop office use is calculated according to the share between active (5.5 hrs/day), standby (2 hrs/day) and off (16.5 hrs/day) modes taken from literature information. This dataset describes the application of a CRT monitor.;
Synonyms: PC; 
UUID: d39d6b75-22e8-3ee8-bc0a-34aac611c1c2
Describes the use of a desktop computer with a CRT monitor. Calculated per 1 hour of computer use in an office. Swiss supply mix applied for electricity consumption (low voltage).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: No technology involved, except for the production of the desktop computer, which is described in another dataset.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: Daily experiences confirm retrieved data from literature.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d39d6b75-22e8-3ee8-bc0a-34aac611c1c2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
